From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryder Belserion <contact@ryderbelserion.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 16:01:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate build script from groovy to kotlin dsl

Dependencies are lifted out of the src/target directory to our own libs.versions.toml and buildSrc directory to avoid having to edit patch files.

Hocon, XML, and typesafe upstream was removed as I don't want or need to maintain them.

SnakeYAML is replaced by my own maintained version instead of a git submodule.

All code linting has been removed, and git wrappers replaced with simpler options.

Multiple java version support has been removed since I only use Java 25

